{"title":"Sand Core","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Dune Elemental, Sand Elemental, Shatterheart</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"dune-elemental\" title=\"Dune Elemental - dropped it in 33 of 50 looted corpses (1/1.5)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/77761b474a7384a1df3e.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Elemental</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.5<br>×1–15</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"sand-elemental\" title=\"Sand Elemental - dropped it in 10 of 17 looted corpses (1/1.7)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/7fd45a0197a0daf36551.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sand Elemental</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.7<br>×2–9</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"glasswrought-colossus\" title=\"Shatterheart - dropped it in 4 of 8 looted corpses (1/2)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/c6160c3c691ea525e4ba.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Shatterheart</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1–2</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"sand-core\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/dd2f532fec666b02e71c.svg\" alt=\"Sand Core\"></div><h3>Sand Core</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n  